@startuml
title TaskPad PHP - Activity Diagram: Create a task (Post/Redirect/Get)
skinparam shadowing false

start
:User opens create.php (GET);
:Server shows empty form with CSRF token;
repeat
  :User submits the form (POST);
  :Server validates and sanitizes input\n(title, priority whitelist, due date) and checks CSRF token;
backward :Server re-renders the form with\nerror messages and the user's entries (HTTP 422);
repeat while (Input valid?) is (no)
->yes;
:TaskRepository appends the task to data/tasks.json;
:Flash message stored in the session;
:Server redirects to index.php (HTTP 303);
:Browser requests the list (GET);
:List page shows the new task and the flash message;
stop
@enduml
